<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Thank you for submitting &nbsp;your Teaching Assistantship application. Please follow the steps below to complete your application:</font></div><div><ol><li><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Spoken English Requirement (Applicants whose native language is not English): Please register for the ASU SPEAK test. Registration is <a href="http://learnenglish.asu.edu/international-teaching-assistants">online</a>. There is a registration fee of $70 that is payable through the website.</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Teaching Demonstration: You must prepare a video recording:</span></li></ol></div></div><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Video Recording</b>: Please prepare and record your teaching demonstration using these guidelines: A video demonstration of piano teaching in English, including two lessons (no more than 20 – 30 minutes) of piano teaching in English, preferably of students at different levels. Individual or group lessons at any level are acceptable. After completing your lessons, please use GoogleDrive and share the link with <a href="mailto:musicadmissions@asu.edu">MusicAdmissions@asu.edu</a>.</span></div></div></blockquote></blockquote><div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">The deadline to submit all of your materials is <b>February 15</b>. Please note that you cannot be considered for an assistantship if you have not met the spoken English requirement. If you have any questions please contact <a href="mailto:musicadmissions@asu.edu">MusicAdmissions@asu.edu</a>.</span></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Sincerely,&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Julie Stephens</b></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div><font face="arial" color="#999999">Coordinator, Academic Affairs + Admissions</font></div><div><font face="arial"><b><font color="#990000">Arizona State University</font>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</b></font><b style="color: rgb(255, 204, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Herberger Institute for Design and the Arts&nbsp;</b></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);">P.O. Box 870405 |&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);">Tempe, Arizona 85287-0405</span></div><div><font color="#999999">Phone: 480-965-5069</font></div></div></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></span></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>